der versions."]],"rec":[["OS","Windows 10 64-bit"],["Processor","Intel i5/Ryzen 5 series"],["Memory","8 GB RAM"],["Graphics","Nvidia GeForce GTX 1660 Ti/AMD RX 5600-XT/Intel Arc A750"],["DirectX","Version 11"],["Storage","120 GB available space"],["Additional Notes","8GB Memory if using integrated GPU. Microsoft no longer supports Windows 10 or older versions."]],"deck":1,"blurb":"Closing out a trilogy that began with Total War: WARHAMMER, this strategy game pairs a campaign map with large real-time battles in the Warhammer fantasy setting. The story turns toward the Realm of Chaos, where a portal opened by a dying god's roar lets the Ruinous Powers loose to spread despair. Kislev and Grand Cathay stand in their way.\n\nThe roster offers seven distinct races and a large range of units, and you command armies in real-time clashes. Options include single-player, co-op and PvP multiplayer. It suits strategy fans who like large-scale battles and managing an empire, especially those who have followed the earlier games."}}